<title>ESTONIA: INTERBANKING LOAN RATE EASES SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>INTERBANKING LOAN RATE EASES SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Estonian interbank</p>
<p>loan rate for one week and one month decreased slightly</p>
<p>compared to the previous week, the country's central bank said</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate remained unchanged.</p>
<p> TALIBOR/TALIBID    1Week     1Month     3Months</p>
<p> May 21	     5.43/4.43  6.00/5.00  7.35/6.35</p>
<p> May 28	     5.20/4.20  5.93/4.93  7.35/6.35</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
